@AIHealthcareSimulation.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5277

### List the sample training scenarios
GET {{AIHealthcareSimulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios
Accept: application/json

### Start a sample simulation
POST {{AIHealthcareSimulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "simulationId": "65c825aa-5ce5-4e8e-9fd8-588f31eb4e7c",
  "scenarioId": "patient-identification",
  "behaviorOptionId": "practice"
}

### Reject an unknown scenario
POST {{AIHealthcareSimulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "simulationId": "65c825aa-5ce5-4e8e-9fd8-588f31eb4e7c",
  "scenarioId": "unknown",
  "behaviorOptionId": "practice"
}
